+
+Leaf natives: GC 15 %; regex natives (`\s+` ≈ 6 %, CJK range ≈ 2 %, `[^\w\s]` ≈ 2 %, TOC regex ≈ 1 %, topic-term regex ≈ 1 %). App code self-time is ≈ 52 %.
+
+### 3.3 By module
+
+| Module | % of blocking |
+|---|---|
+| passage-retrieval | 49.0 |
+| runtime / GC / no app frame | 19.7 |
+| corpus-boilerplate | 16.0 |
+| analyzer | 4.3 |
